{"sha": "760ef1c6013b1ddda5f1692db9ce361bda0e4e6b244003bb07dd5b2df8f0a966", "body": [" \\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:rigid-body-mechanics} 章 --- 刚体力学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:1}", "(a) $\\tfrac1{12}M\\ell^2 = \\qty{4.2e-2}{kg.m^2}$；绕一端（惠更斯，", "$d = \\ell/2$）：$\\tfrac13M\\ell^2 = \\qty{0.167}{kg.m^2}$。(b) $\\tfrac12MR^2 =", "\\qty{4.0e-2}{kg.m^2}$；绕边缘：$\\tfrac32MR^2 = \\qty{0.12}{kg.m^2}$。", "(c) $\\tfrac25 \\times 0.16 \\times (0.0285)^2 = \\qty{5.2e-5}{kg.m^2}$。(d) 圆环，", "$MR^2$ 与 $\\tfrac12MR^2$ 相比：两倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:2}", "$v = \\qty{5.0}{m/s}$，$\\omega = v/R = 5/0.35 = \\qty{14.3}{rad/s}$。顶部：", "$2v = \\qty{10}{m/s}$，向前；底部：$0$；前部：$\\vect v_G + \\vect\\Omega", "\\wedge\\vect{GM} = (v, -v)$，即 $v\\sqrt2 = \\qty{7.1}{m/s}$，方向与水平成", "\\qty{45}{\\degree} 向下。相对自行车，轮胎各处的速度均为", "$R\\omega = v = \\qty{5}{m/s}$，处处如此。石子以 \\qty{10}{m/s}", "的速度水平向前飞出。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:3}", "$J = \\tfrac12 \\times 40 \\times 0.25^2 = \\qty{1.25}{kg.m^2}$; $\\omega = \\qty{628}{rad/s}$.", "(a) $E = \\tfrac12J\\omega^2 = \\qty{246}{kJ}$。(b) $\\Gamma = J\\omega/\\Delta t =", "1.25 \\times 628/120 = \\qty{6.5}{N.m}$；末时刻功率 $P = \\Gamma\\omega = \\qty{4.1}{kW}$。", "(c) 取出 \\qty{200}{kJ} 后剩余 \\qty{46}{kJ}：$\\omega = \\sqrt{2 \\times 46\\,000/1.25}", "= \\qty{271}{rad/s} = \\qty{2600}{rpm}$。(d) 转子边缘的空气阻力随", "$\\omega^2$ 增大（功率随 $\\omega^3$ 增大），会使转子发热并减速；在", "真空中、采用磁悬浮轴承时，损耗降至几瓦。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:4}", "$J = \\tfrac12MR^2 + MR^2 = \\tfrac32MR^2$，$d = R$：$\\ell_{\\text{等效}} = \\tfrac32R", "= \\qty{0.30}{m}$，$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{0.30/9.81} = \\qty{1.10}{s}$。在 $R/2$ 处：$J =", "\\tfrac12MR^2 + \\tfrac14MR^2 = \\tfrac34MR^2$，$d = R/2$，$\\ell_{\\text{等效}} =", "\\tfrac32R$ 同样成立，周期相同。一般地，$\\ell_{\\text{等效}}(d) = (R^2/2 +", "d^2)/d$，在 $d = R/\\sqrt2$ 时取最小值：$\\ell_{\\text{等效}} = R\\sqrt2 = \\qty{0.283}{m}$，", "$T = \\qty{1.07}{s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:5}", "(a) $\\tan20^\\circ = 0.36 \\le f(1 + k)/k$，即 $\\le 0.6$（圆环），$0.9$", "（圆盘），$1.05$（球）：均能滚动。(b) $v = \\sqrt{2gh/(1 + k)}$：圆环", "\\qty{4.4}{m/s}，圆盘 \\qty{5.1}{m/s}，球 \\qty{5.3}{m/s}；球最先到达，圆环", "最后。(c) 斜面长度 $h/\\sin\\alpha = \\qty{5.85}{m}$，$a = g\\sin\\alpha/(1 + k) =", "1.68$, $2.24$, $\\qty{2.40}{m/s^2}$, $t = \\sqrt{2d/a} = 2.6$, $2.3$, \\qty{2.2}{s}.", "(d) $T = \\dfrac{k}{1 + k}Mg\\sin\\alpha = \\tfrac27Mg\\sin\\alpha$；接触", "点静止，因此 $\\vect T\\cdot\\vect v_I = 0$。(e) 圆环：$\\tan\\alpha >", "2f = 0.6$，$\\alpha > \\qty{31}{\\degree}$；球：$\\tan\\alpha > 3.5f = 1.05$，", "$\\alpha > \\qty{46}{\\degree}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:6}", "$\\Gamma = 2fNr = 2 \\times 0.4 \\times 800 \\times 0.12 = \\qty{77}{N.m}$; $\\dot\\omega =", "\\Gamma/J = \\qty{64}{rad/s^2}$; $\\omega_0 = \\qty{94}{rad/s}$, $t = \\qty{1.5}{s}$;", "$\\theta = \\omega_0^2/2\\dot\\omega = \\qty{69}{rad} = 11$ 圈；生热 $= \\tfrac12J", "\\omega_0^2 = \\qty{5.3}{kJ}$, $\\Delta T = 5300/(1.5 \\times 470) = \\qty{7.6}{K}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:7}", "(a) 绳子必须施加净力矩才能使滑轮加速转动：$T_1 \\ne T_2$。", "(b) $m_1a = m_1g - T_1$，$m_2a = T_2 - m_2g$，$J\\dot\\omega = (T_1 - T_2)R$，其中", "$a = R\\dot\\omega$: $a = (m_1 - m_2)g/(m_1 + m_2 + J/R^2) = 0.5 \\times 9.81/4.0 =", "\\qty{1.23}{m/s^2}$。(c) $T_1 = m_1(g - a) = \\qty{17.2}{N}$，$T_2 = m_2(g + a) =", "\\qty{16.6}{N}$。(d) 滑轮无质量时：\\qty{1.40}{m/s^2}。能量法：$(m_1 - m_2)gx =", "\\tfrac12(m_1 + m_2 + J/R^2)v^2$；对时间求导。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:8}", "(a) 重力 $mg$ 作用于中点；墙面：顶端水平方向的 $N_w$；地面：", "竖直方向的 $N = mg$，以及水平方向的摩擦力 $T = N_w$。对", "脚端取矩：$mg\\,\\tfrac{\\ell}2\\cos\\theta = N_w\\ell\\sin\\theta$。(b) $T = N_w =", "mg/(2\\tan\\theta) \\le fmg \\iff \\tan\\theta \\ge 1/2f$。(c) $\\tan\\theta \\ge", "1.25$，$\\theta \\ge \\qty{51}{\\degree}$。(d) 人位于 $x$ 处：$N = 4mg$，$N_w =", "mg(\\tfrac12 + 3x/\\ell)/\\tan60^\\circ \\le 4fmg = 1.6mg$: $x/\\ell \\le (2.77 -", "0.5)/3 = 0.76$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:9}", "(a) 接触点以 $v + R\\omega$ 向前运动（$\\omega > 0$ 对应", "逆旋）：摩擦力 $-fmg$ 作用于质心，$\\dot v = -fg$；力矩", "$-fmgR$ 作用于自旋：$\\dot\\omega = -5fg/2R$。(b) 滑动速度 $v + R\\omega = v_0 +", "R\\omega_0 - \\tfrac72fgt$ 在 $t_1 = 2(v_0 + R\\omega_0)/7fg$ 时为零，此后 $v_1", "= v_0 - fgt_1 = (5v_0 - 2R\\omega_0)/7$。(c) $v_1 < 0 \\iff R\\omega_0 > \\tfrac52v_0$。", "(d) $t_1 = 16/(7 \\times 1.96) = \\qty{1.2}{s}$；$v_1 = (10 - 12)/7 = \\qty{-0.29}{m/s}$：", "球折返。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:10}", "(a) 取 $x$ 指向拉力方向，摩擦力 $T$ 沿 $x$ 方向：$Ma = F + T$；", "对 $G$ 取矩（逆时针为正）：$rF + RT = -kMRa$（滚动，$\\omega_z", "= -a/R$）。因此 $a = F(R - r)/(1 + k)MR > 0$：线轴", "\\emph{朝向}拉力方向滚动，将线绕上。(b) $T = -F(kR + r)/(1 +", "k)R$（向后）；若 $F \\le fMg(1 + k)R/(kR + r)$，则不滑动。(c) 线的", "作用线与轮毂相切；其对接触", "点 $I$ 的力矩为 $F(r - R\\cos\\beta)$，顺时针（向前滚动），当 $\\cos\\beta >", "r/R$，作用线过 $I$ 时力矩为零 --- 即瞬时轴", "--- 此时 $a = F(R\\cos\\beta - r)/(1 + k)MR$，$T = -F(kR\\cos\\beta + r)/(1 + k)R$，", "$N = Mg - F\\sin\\beta$。(d) 当 $\\cos\\beta < r/R$ 时，对 $I$ 的力矩为", "逆时针：线轴\\emph{背离}拉绳者滚动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:rigid-body-mechanics:11}", "(a) $Mv_0 = P$；对 $G$ 取矩：$\\tfrac25MR^2\\omega_0 = P(h - R)$（上旋方向", "$h > R$ 时）。(b) $v_0 = R\\omega_0 \\iff 2R = 5(h - R) \\iff h = \\tfrac75R$；高于此值时", "$R\\omega_0 > v_0$（上旋），低于此值时为逆旋或下旋。(c)", "$\\omega_0 = 0$：滑动持续 $t_1 = 2v_0/7fg = \\qty{0.44}{s}$，滑动距离 $v_0t_1 -", "\\tfrac12fgt_1^2 = \\qty{1.1}{m}$。(d) 位于 $\\tfrac75R$ 处的缓冲垫使球", "无滑动滚动：没有滑动阶段，不会在台面上损失速率，", "回弹可预测。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}